<!-- MARKET SUMMARY -->
<div class="market-summary">
  <p>The global crypto market cap is <strong>$2.56T</strong>, a <strong style="color:var(--green)">1.47% increase</strong> over the last day. The total crypto market volume over the last 24 hours is <strong>$156.9B</strong>, a <strong style="color:var(--green)">14.51% increase</strong>. The total volume in DeFi is currently $12.2B, 7.78% of the total crypto market 24-hour volume. The volume of all stablecoins is $195.53B, representing 124.63% of total 24-hour volume. Bitcoin's dominance is currently <strong>59.04%</strong>, a decrease of 0.05% over the day.</p>
